# Geometric completion of the original-target restart chart

Packet PROVE-AUX61-R1. `exists_history_original_target_geometric_chart` builds
the measurable original-target component selector and inherited restart chart
from the source's current-access incidence and a live real target mark.

The canonical compact record is `closure (stripTargetHull D)`. Its compactness,
lower-half-plane connectivity, exact filling identity and dyadic-hit
measurability are all proved. The target marking and current whole collar are
also proved. A separated actual force at -1 supplies target protection through
the real-flow API; a fresh interior continuation supplies access incidence.

The application must identify those inputs for its actual counterflow word
and current target-component event. No field-kernel or fibre-cover assertion
is made, and no post-contact kernel is used in this prerequisite of (E1).
